em on.',ap2:'Beninese hosts who welcome you',ap2d:'Guides, artisans, cooks, families: every stop is shared with local people who tell their own story. Your stay supports the people who host you.',ap3:'Experts at every level',ap3d:'We are a team of passionate, professional and dynamic young people. Each tour is designed by our experts and heritage managers, then led on the ground by skilled guides, experienced drivers, and hoteliers and restaurateurs chosen for their reliability.',ap4:'Your safety comes first',ap4d:'Familiar routes, vehicles with a driver, sites visited with their custodians, schedules and meeting points announced in advance. Our team stays reachable throughout your stay by WhatsApp or phone.',ap5:'An enjoyable, unforgettable trip',ap5d:'We are here to make you happy. Pace, meals, accommodation, transport: every detail is arranged for your comfort and enjoyment. You go home with memories and encounters, not worries.',ap6:'Tailor-made, from Benin to the rest of Africa',ap6d:'Benin remains our main destination, and from Benin you can go far: we also organize trips to Togo, Ghana, Côte d’Ivoire and other countries. A special request? We build the stay with you: tours, accommodation, transport, length and budget.',ap7:'A team at your service, clear prices',ap7d:'The same team, in French or English, from your first message to your return home. Prices are announced in FCFA before departure, with an estimate in your currency. Pay by Mobile Money, bank card or in cash at the agency.',appC1:'Plan my stay',appC2:'Request my stay',pE:'Before you go',pT:'Your questions',q1:'How long is an outing?',a1:'Two to four hours for most tours. We can also build a stay of several days, up to three weeks.',q2:'What are the prices?',a2:'Prices are in CFA francs per person, with a euro display available. For tours on quote, we work out the price with you before departure, with no surprises.',q3:'How do I book?',a3:'Add your tours and send the request: we reply by email or WhatsApp with times and meeting point. No online payment is requested on the site.',q4:'What are the entry requirements for Benin?',a4:'Most travellers need a passport valid for at least six months after arrival and an e-visa requested online before departure on the official site evisa.bj. ECOWAS citizens do not need a visa. A yellow fever vaccination is recommended and may be requested depending on where you travel from: check the current rules before you leave. Tell us your nationality and we will explain the steps.',gE:'Gallery',gT:'Our trips in pictures',gD:'Browse our trips in pictures: the next one could be yours.',shE:'Your memories',shT:'Share your travel photos',shD:'Send a photo or a short video. Every file is checked before publication.',files:'Photos and videos',fileh:'JPG, PNG, WebP, MP4 or WebM. Several files allowed.',caption:'Caption',cons1:'Publish this on the site after approval? *',cons2:'Use it in our communications? *',yes:'Yes',no:'No',send:'Send',rvE:'Traveller reviews',rvT:'Their words, their journeys',rvEmpty:'No reviews published yet. Travelled with us? Tell us about it, it will be read then published.',rvW:'Write a review',rvH:'Tell us about your trip',rvB:'Your review',rvN:'Your name',rvM:'Your email (not published)',rvS:'Publish my review',rvOk:'Thank you. Your review will be published after our team checks it.',noav:'No rating',qE:'Your request',qT:'Let’s talk about your trip',qD:'Tell us what you would like to see and when. We reply with a clear proposal.',qS:'Chosen tours',qNone:'None yet. Add some from the list.',qGo:'Choose a tour',name:'Name',contact:'Email or WhatsApp',date:'Preferred date',pax:'Travellers',msg:'Your project',est:'Estimate',estn:'Indicative, confirmed by our team.',onq:'on quote',sendq:'Send my request',wa:'Write on WhatsApp',okq:'Mockup: your request would be sent here.',emp:'Add a tour first, or describe your project.',ft1:'Explore',ft2:'Contact us',foot:'Discover Africa through Benin.',demo:'Official website of A